# Game Systems Directory

This folder will contain system abstractions:
- PhysicsSystem.js - Physics abstraction (Matter.js -> Planck.js upgrade point)
- RenderSystem.js - Rendering abstraction (Phaser -> PixiJS upgrade point)
- AudioSystem.js - Sound management
- InputSystem.js - Keyboard/touch handling
- ScoreSystem.js - Scoring and multipliers

See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for system layer design.
